OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start with chance of a
OL,6,Ffew fog patches. Otherwise mostly dry
OL,7,Fwith a quite cloudy start but bright
OL,8,For sunny spells developing. The odd
OL,9,Fshower possible around the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with some clear spells
OL,12,Fand light winds allowing overnight
OL,13,Ffrost to develop in places, as well as
OL,14,Fa few fog patches. Cloudier around the
OL,15,Fcoasts.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA dry but chilly morning with
OL,18,Fbright or sunny spells. Turning
OL,19,Fcloudier later with a few showers
OL,20,Fspreading south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
