OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FColder
OL,6,FWednesday and Thursday as a freshening
OL,7,Fnortherly wind brings bright spells
OL,8,Fand scattered showers, heavy and
OL,9,Fperhaps wintry for a time. Dry with
OL,10,Fsunny spells Friday. Overnight frost
OL,11,Fpossible.
